<title>JAPAN: SOCCER--VELEZ SARSFIELD BEAT RIVER PLATE IN RECOPA FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER--VELEZ SARSFIELD BEAT RIVER PLATE IN RECOPA FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Velez Sarsfield beat fellow Argentine side River Plate 4-2 on penalties (halftime 1-0, full time 1-1) after extra time in the final of the Recopa Cup on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Velez - Jose Luis Chilavert 29</p>
<p>		 River Plate - Enzo Francescoli 82</p>
</text>
